OL,3,AAction on energy costs is my overriding
OL,4,Aaim, says Fahnbulleh
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe energy secretary has stressed that
OL,7,Faffordability is her "overriding
OL,8,Fobjective", as she said reducing bills
OL,9,Fwould be key to maintaining public
OL,10,Fsupport for climate action.
OL,12,FSpeaking to BBC Panorama, Miatta
OL,13,FFahnbulleh insisted that the
OL,14,Fgovernment's drive for cleaner power
OL,15,Fwould help to cut energy bills in the
OL,16,Flong term.
OL,18,FBut she conceded that the push to
OL,19,Freduce carbon emissions was currently
OL,20,F"under pressure" amid discontent at
OL,21,Frising prices in recent years.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
