OL,3,AAction on energy costs is my overriding
OL,4,Aaim, says Fahnbulleh
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as ministers grapple with how
OL,7,Fto respond to a predicted surge in
OL,8,Fenergy prices in January, expected to
OL,9,Fmark the biggest rise in bills for four
OL,10,Fyears.
